    "text": "kroxam.com\nwebsite\nCrookston\nFischer Rust Law Firm – Legal Assistant/Secretary\n1 days ago\nLEGAL ASSISTANT/SECRETARY: A full-service regional law firm in Crookston, Minnesota, has an opening for a full-time legal assistant. Responsibilities include word processing, transcribing, acquiring and reviewing records, drafting and editing documents, answering telephones, general clerical assignments and interaction with clients. We are looking for a motivated team player that is well organized, professional and energetic. Salary is dependent upon experience and experience is preferred, although not required. Send letter of application, resume, and references to: Trent J. Fischer, Fischer Rust Law Firm, PLLC, 407 N. Broadway, P.O. Box 605, Crookston, MN 56716-0605. Applications may also be emailed to tfischer@crookstonlaw.com or faxed to 218-281-5831.",
